  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Desde adentro: A Documentary Feature Film</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In the midst of uncertainty and socio-political oppression, &quot;Desde adentro&quot; follows young community leaders committed to fighting for their right to remain in Puerto Rico through sustainable community development. This feature-length documentary shows a distinctive angle that follows the slow path of recovery and the dialogue between their self-managed projects and political and economic undertones of colonialism.</narrative>
  </description>
